      "peak_abs": 0.5483
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.2435,
      "audio_seconds": 4.96,
      "rtf": 0.2507,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5154
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.09,
      "audio_seconds": 4.4,
      "rtf": 0.2477,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3652
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.4425,
      "audio_seconds": 5.72,
      "rtf": 0.2522,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3929
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.1558,
      "audio_seconds": 4.64,
      "rtf": 0.2491,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4949
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0323,
      "audio_seconds": 4.12,
      "rtf": 0.2505,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3449
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.113,
      "audio_seconds": 4.44,
      "rtf": 0.2507,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4202
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.2711,
      "audio_seconds": 5.12,
      "rtf": 0.2483,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3625
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/complex_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.117,
      "audio_seconds": 4.44,
      "rtf": 0.2516,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.2984
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_00",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "I read the report yesterday, and I will read the summary tonight.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/heteronyms_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8112,
      "audio_seconds": 3.12,
      "rtf": 0.26,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4735
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_01",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "The lead engineer removed the lead pipe from the basement.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/heteronyms_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.7189,
      "audio_seconds": 2.8,
      "rtf": 0.2567,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.2799
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_02",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "They live near the studio where the live broadcast is recorded.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo-s99/heteronyms_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.8362,
      "audio_seconds": 3.24,
      "rtf": 0.2581,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3661
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_03",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "He plays bass guitar, though he would rather be fishing for bass.",
